        skos:definition        "\"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area.  The \"atmosphere content\" of a quantity refers to the vertical integral from the surface to the top of the atmosphere. For the content between specified levels in the atmosphere, standard names including content_of_atmosphere_layer are used.  The chemical symbol for atomic bromine is Br."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::CF12N11";
