        skos:definition        "\"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Pd\" means the element \"palladium\" and \"111mPd\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"palladium-111\" with a half-life of 2.29e-01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::MBSIZL7C";
