        skos:definition        "\"tendency_of_X\" means derivative of X with respect to time.  The construction \"moles_of_X_in_atmosphere\" means the total number of moles of X contained in the entire atmosphere, i.e, summed over the atmospheric column and over the entire globe.    The chemical formula of CFC12 is CF2Cl2.  The IUPAC name for CFC12 is dichloro-difluoro-methane."@en;
