        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P02/current/HLAT/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P04/current/G147/>;
        skos:definition        "\"tendency_of_X\" means derivative of X with respect to time.  The construction \"middle_atmosphere_moles_of_X\" means the total number of moles of X in the troposphere and stratosphere, i.e. summed over that part of the atmospheric column and over the entire globe. The chemical formula for methyl bromide is CH3Br. The IUPAC name for methyl bromide is bromomethane."@en;
