        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/P17PLD3O/3/>;
        pav:hasVersion         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/P17PLD3O/2/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/P17PLD3O/1/>;
        pav:version            "3";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "true";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/ZA3PM5VL/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/standard_name/integral_wrt_depth_of_product_of_sea_water_density_and_potential_temperature/> , <http://mmisw.org/ont/cf/parameter/integral_wrt_depth_of_product_of_sea_water_density_and_potential_temperature>;
        owl:versionInfo        "3";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The phrase \"integral_wrt_X_of_Y\" means int Y dX. To specify the limits of the integral the data variable should have an axis for X and associated coordinate bounds. If no axis for X is associated with the data variable, or no coordinate bounds are specified, it is assumed that the integral is calculated over the entire vertical extent of the medium, e.g, if the medium is air the integral is assumed to be calculated over the full depth of the atmosphere. The phrase \"wrt\" means \"with respect to\". The phrase \"product_of_X_and_Y\" means X*Y. Depth is the vertical distance below the surface. Sea water density is the in-situ density (not the potential density). For Boussinesq models, density is the constant Boussinesq reference density, a quantity which has the standard name reference_sea_water_density_for_boussinesq_approximation. Potential temperature is the temperature a parcel of air or sea water would have if moved adiabatically to sea level pressure."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::P17PLD3O";
        skos:note              "deprecated"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "integral_wrt_depth_of_product_of_sea_water_density_and_potential_temperature"@en;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P06/current/DKM2/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/CFSN0551/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::CFSN0551";
        dc:date                "2006-09-26 18:12:43.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::CFSN0551";
