        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The surface called \"surface\" means the lower boundary of the atmosphere. \"Content\" indicates a quantity per unit area. \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Ru\" means the element \"ruthenium\" and \"105Ru\" is the isotope \"ruthenium-105\" with a half-life of 1.85e-01 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::F4EUFP48";
