<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/5QAZTACX/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::5QAZTACX";
        dc:date                "2024-05-20 20:39:48.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::5QAZTACX";
        pav:authoredOn         "2024-05-20 20:39:48.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/5QAZTACX/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/standard_name/remote_sensing_averaging_kernel_of_logarithm_of_mole_fraction_of_methane_in_air/> , <http://mmisw.org/ont/cf/parameter/remote_sensing_averaging_kernel_of_logarithm_of_mole_fraction_of_methane_in_air>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "Logarithmic scale averaging kernels of the methane mole fractions obtained by a remote sensing observation (Rodgers, 2020). These kernels are also called fractional averaging kernels (Keppens et al., 2015) They represent the fractional changes of methane in the retrieved atmosphere relative to the fractional changes of methane in the true atmosphere."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::5QAZTACX";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "remote_sensing_averaging_kernel_of_logarithm_of_mole_fraction_of_methane_in_air"@en;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P06/current/UUUU/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/AJSOO1ST/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::AJSOO1ST";
        dc:date                "2018-02-12 16:53:18.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::AJSOO1ST";
        pav:authoredOn         "2018-02-12 16:53:18.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/AJSOO1ST/1/>;
        pav:version            "1";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/standard_name/integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_242m1Am_in_air/> , <http://mmisw.org/ont/cf/parameter/integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_242m1Am_in_air>;
        owl:versionInfo        "1";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The phrase \"integral_wrt_X_of_Y\" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase \"wrt\" means \"with respect to\". \"Radioactivity\" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. \"Radioactivity concentration\" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. \"Am\" means the element \"americium\" and \"242m1Am\" is the metastable state of the isotope \"americium-242\" with a half-life of 5.53e+04 days."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::AJSOO1ST";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_242m1Am_in_air"@en;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P06/current/BSM3/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/KWC6XKDV/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::KWC6XKDV";
        dc:date                "2018-08-06 12:15:46.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::KWC6XKDV";
        pav:authoredOn         "2018-08-06 12:15:46.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/KWC6XKDV/2/>;
        pav:hasVersion         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/KWC6XKDV/1/>;
        pav:version            "2";
        void:inDataset         <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/.well-known/void>;
        owl:deprecated         "false";
        owl:sameAs             <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/standard_name/change_over_time_in_thermal_energy_content_of_ice_and_snow_on_land/> , <http://mmisw.org/ont/cf/parameter/change_over_time_in_thermal_energy_content_of_ice_and_snow_on_land>;
        owl:versionInfo        "2";
        skos:altLabel          "";
        skos:definition        "The phrase \"change_over_time_in_X\" means change in a quantity X over a time-interval, which should be defined by the bounds of the time coordinate. Thermal energy is the total vibrational energy, kinetic and potential, of all the molecules and atoms in a substance. The phrase \"ice_and_snow_on_land\" means ice in glaciers, ice caps, ice sheets and shelves, river and lake ice, any other ice on a land surface, such as frozen flood water, and snow lying on such ice or on the land surface."@en;
        skos:notation          "SDN:P07::KWC6XKDV";
        skos:note              "accepted"@en;
        skos:prefLabel         "change_over_time_in_thermal_energy_content_of_ice_and_snow_on_land"@en;
        skos:related           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P06/current/JMSQ/> .

<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/FK88QDQ8/>
        rdf:type               skos:Concept;
        dce:identifier         "SDN:P07::FK88QDQ8";
        dc:date                "2018-02-12 16:53:18.0";
        dc:identifier          "SDN:P07::FK88QDQ8";
        pav:authoredOn         "2018-02-12 16:53:18.0";
        pav:hasCurrentVersion  <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/FK88QDQ8/1/>;
